OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMainly dry during daytime with
OL,6,Fsome sunny spells for Shetland but the
OL,7,Fodd light shower not to be ruled out.
OL,8,FBest of the brighter spells for Orkney
OL,9,Fwill be in the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA dry and bright evening with
OL,12,Flight winds. Cloud will thicken across
OL,13,FOrkney later, with rain arriving
OL,14,Faround midnight accompanied by
OL,15,Ffreshening winds. Shetland will remain
OL,16,Fdry throughout.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
