OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FCloudy and rather wet for
OL,6,FOrkney, the rain heavy at times.
OL,7,FMainly dry and bright for Shetland,
OL,8,Fjust the chance of a little light rain
OL,9,Fin the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,12,FNortherly winds prevailing during this
OL,13,Fperiod bring rather cool conditions
OL,14,Fwith variable cloud amounts and a few
OL,15,Fscattered showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
